     <p><M05C2-CONSUMERS status="spec/done">Every original incoming consumer edge, selection intent, version constraint and provenance survives candidate rejection unchanged. Evaluate all consumers of one configuration together through the B2 evaluator. A valid older candidate may satisfy the same authorized intent. Conflict evidence retains original consumer reasons alongside the candidate coordinate and exact C1 identity; source errors remain operational errors, never candidate exclusions.</M05C2-CONSUMERS></p>
